Yes, Slack is a supported channel for filing tickets.

- **Slash command** — requesters use `/northline` to file a ticket directly from Slack without leaving the app [1].
- **Inline replies** — agents can respond to the ticket right inside the Slack thread, and the conversation syncs back to the ticket automatically [1].
- **Unified queue** — Slack tickets land in the same triage queue as email and web form requests, keeping full channel context [1].

For setup details, see [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) or check integration docs.

